\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. When we walk with the Lord
\par In the light of His Word
\par What a glory He sheds on our way!
\par While we do His good will,
\par He abides with us still,
\par And with all who will trust and obey.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Trust and obey, for there is no other way
\par To be happy in Jesus,
\par But to trust and obey.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Not a shaddow can rise,
\par Not a cloud in the skies,
\par But His smile quickly drives it away;
\par Not a doubt nor a fear,
\par Not a sigh nor a tear,
\par Can abide while we trust and obey.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Trust and obey, for there is no other way
\par To be happy in Jesus,
\par But to trust and obey.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Not a burden we bear,
\par Not a sorrow we share,
\par But our toil He doth richly repay;
\par Not a grief nor a loss,
\par Not a frown nor a cross,
\par But is blest if we trust and obey.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Trust and obey, for there is no other way
\par To be happy in Jesus,
\par But to trust and obey.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. But we never can prove
\par The delights of His love
\par Until all on the alter we lay;
\par For the favour He shows,
\par And the joy He bestows,
\par Are for them who will trust and obey.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Trust and obey, for there is no other way
\par To be happy in Jesus,
\par But to trust and obey.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5. Then in fellowship sweet
\par We will sit at His feet,
\par Or we'll walk by His side on the way;
\par What He says we will do,
\par Where He sends we will go-
\par Never fear, only trust and obey.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Trust and obey, for there is no other way
\par To be happy in Jesus,
\par But to trust and obey.
\par 
\par 
\par 
\par 
